OL,3,GNEWSAKatie Amess: 'Dad's legacy is one
OL,4,Aof love'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe daughter of murdered MP Sir David
OL,7,FAmess said his legacy "is one of love"
OL,8,Fon the fifth anniversary of his death.
OL,10,FKatie Amess told the BBC her father was
OL,11,Fremembered fondly by "thousands and
OL,12,Fthousands" of people and that she
OL,13,Fmissed him terribly.
OL,15,FSir David was the Conservative MP for
OL,16,FSouthend West when he was stabbed to
OL,17,Fdeath while holding a constituency
OL,18,Fsurgery in Leigh-on-Sea on 15 October
OL,19,F2021.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
