OL,3,GNEWSAKatie Amess: 'Dad's legacy is one
OL,4,Aof love'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"My dad's legacy is one of love and
OL,7,Fjust being the biggest example of what
OL,8,Fa constituency MP should be," Amess
OL,9,Fsaid. "Somebody that is there for the
OL,10,Fpeople, that is in politics for the
OL,11,Fright reasons."
